<title>UK: Biocompatibles names new finance director.</title>
<headline>Biocompatibles names new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biocompatibles International Plc said on Tuesday it had apppointed Julian Steadman as finance director.</p>
<p>Steadman replaces John Bardwell who becomes senior executive director responsible for patent, legal and secretarial matters.</p>
<p>Steadman was previously the group finance director of Eyecare Products Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
